title: Ramu_Day6
position: 189,214
---
<<PlayBackgroundMusic Light_3>>
<<SetBGSprite HutInterior>>

The sky is still dark when Ramu wakes his brother. Yesterday's conversation has forced him to confront whether Raju is prepared for serious training.

Pre-dawn darkness envelops their small home. Ramu's serious expression reflects a night of contemplation about advancing to the next level.

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Serious>>
Ramu: Wake up, little brother.

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Determined>>
Ramu: If you want to play cricket seriously, if you want me to consider that tournament...

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Serious>>
Ramu: You need to show me something today.

<<SetCharacterExpression Raju Excited>>
Raju: Show you what, bhaiya? I'll do anything.

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Serious>>
Ramu: I mean proper cricket training. Not the gentle practice we've been doing.

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Determined>>
Ramu: Real training - the kind that hurts.

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Serious>>
Ramu: The kind that tests everything you think you know about wanting something.

<<SetCharacterExpression Raju Confident>>
Raju: I'm ready, bhaiya. I've been ready for days.

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Serious>>
Ramu: This isn't a game.

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Determined>>
Ramu: For the next two hours, you'll face deliveries at different speeds, different angles.

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Serious>>
Ramu: You'll run suicides between wickets until your legs shake.

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Determined>>
Ramu: You'll practice defensive shots until your hands blister.

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Serious>>
Ramu: And you'll do it all without complaining.

<<SetCharacterExpression Raju Excited>>
Raju: And if I do well?

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Serious>>
Ramu: If you do well, if you show me the dedication that tournament play requires...

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Serious>>
Ramu: Then maybe - maybe I'll believe you're serious about this dream.

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Skeptical>>
Ramu: Tired yet?

<<SetCharacterExpression Raju Determined>>
Raju: No, bhaiya. Keep going.

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Serious>>
Ramu: Your hands are red. Your form is getting sloppy.

<<SetCharacterExpression Raju Determined>>
Raju: Then show me how to do it better. Don't make it easier.

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Astonished>>
Ramu: ...You didn't complain once.

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Proud>>
Ramu: Not even when I made you repeat that difficult leg-side glance fifteen times.

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Smiling>>
Ramu: Not even when your hands started hurting.

<<SetCharacterExpression Raju Excited>>
Raju: Because I want this, bhaiya. I really want to play cricket.

<<SetCharacterExpression Raju Determined>>
Raju: Not just for fun, but for real.

<<SetCharacterExpression Raju Serious>>
Raju: Like those players you talked to yesterday.

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Serious>>
Ramu: Want is not enough.

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Determined>>
Ramu: Cricket requires dedication every single day.

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Serious>>
Ramu: Even when you don't feel like it, even when it hurts, even when you fail.

<<SetCharacterExpression Raju Determined>>
Raju: Then I'll be dedicated. Every single day.

<<SetCharacterExpression Raju Confident>>
Raju: You'll see.

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Proud>>
Ramu: I think... I think you might actually mean that.

<<SetCharacterExpression Raju Excited>>
Raju: I do mean it. So what happens now?

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Confident>>
Ramu: Now we find out if you're serious about that tournament.

<<HideAllCharacters>>

As the grueling training session concludes, both understand they've crossed a threshold from casual practice to serious athletic development.

