<<PlayBackgroundMusic Light_3>>
<<SetBGSprite HutInterior>>

After six consecutive days of consistent practice, Raju joins his brother for another morning session. Today's practice will likely draw attention from neighbors.

The narrow courtyard has become unexpected neighborhood entertainment. Curious residents time their morning activities to witness the intense training sessions.

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Smiling>>
Ramu: Ready for today's session, champ?

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Excited>>
Ramu: Word's gotten around the neighborhood about your batting yesterday.

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Smiling>>
Ramu: Mrs. Das asked me if you're really serious about this tournament.

<<SetCharacterExpression Raju Excited>>
Raju: What did you tell her, bhai?

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Confident>>
Ramu: I told her to watch this morning's practice and decide for herself.

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Proud>>
Ramu: Six days ago, I thought this was just another childhood phase.

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Smiling>>
Ramu: But watching you practice every single morning...

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Proud>>
Ramu: Seeing how you listen to every suggestion...

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Excited>>
Ramu: How you practice the same shot fifty times until you get it right...

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Astonished>>
Ramu: These people have seen you grow up.

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Excited>>
Ramu: They've watched a hundred kids play cricket in these lanes.

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Proud>>
Ramu: But they're gathering to watch you practice.

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Excited>>
Ramu: That means something, Raju. That means you're not just playing anymore.

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Proud>>
Ramu: You're performing.

<<SetCharacterExpression Raju Excited>>
Raju: It feels different today.

<<SetCharacterExpression Raju Confident>>
Raju: Like I'm not just hitting balls - like I'm proving something.

<<SetCharacterExpression MrsDas Excited>>
Mrs. Sharma: Ramu beta, is your little brother going to play in that big tournament?

<<SetCharacterExpression MrsDas Astonished>>
Mrs. Sharma: The whole building is talking about his cricket!

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Excited>>
Ramu: Sharma aunty, come down and see for yourself!

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Proud>>
Ramu: Six days of sunrise practice - he hasn't missed a single morning!

<<SetCharacterExpression Raju Determined>>
Raju: Bhai, I won't let you down.

<<SetCharacterExpression Raju Serious>>
Raju: Not after everything you've taught me this week.

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Proud>>
Ramu: You've already made me proud, little brother.

<<SetCharacterExpression Ramu Excited>>
Ramu: Now let's show them what six days of real practice looks like.

